WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:26.430
- [Narrator] Since the 15th century,

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:28.480
the Tatra Mountains in
Poland have been home

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:32.890
to a very special type of
handmade cheese, oscypek.

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:35.390
Authentic versions of
this milky, smoky cheese

00:00:35.390 --> 00:00:38.178
are only made in this region, usually in

00:00:38.178 --> 00:00:39.180
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:40.110
cheese huts.

00:00:40.110 --> 00:00:42.330
And Janina is one of its makers.

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.393
She is a baca.

00:00:53.808 --> 00:00:54.890
- [Narrator] In oscypek tradition,

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:56.900
its maker is usually a man,

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:00.130
and the secret process is
passed down from father to son.

00:01:00.130 --> 00:01:02.430
However, Janina broke from the mold,

00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.853
becoming one of the only female masters.

00:01:29.657 --> 00:01:32.320
- [Narrator] And this milk is
sacred for authentic oscypek,

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:35.890
which requires at least
60 percent sheep's milk.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.450
Everything from the grass they eat

00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:40.050
to how cold they get
is a concern for Janina

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.200
and those who help her.

00:02:31.435 --> 00:02:35.185
(gentle instrumental music)

